{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to PuPu's Adventure Park! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's what you need to know about this &quot;PARK&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/93ab8e3e87773ffe2928355e58e3cef6.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/93ab8e3e87773ffe2928355e58e3cef6.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/93ab8e3e87773ffe2928355e58e3cef6.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In a not-so-far planet called MoeStar, a long established peace between all clans was disrupted when the Dark Goblins acquired a mysterious &quot;summoning&quot; power, leading to their dominance over the other clans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the long-suffering clans, the PuPu clan, out of desperation and destitution as their life source depletes, are forced to sign a lease from the Goblins to run one of their businesses on the planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The PuPu clan set up shop on this new lease - an Adventure Park - attracting &quot;heroes&quot; who are summoned through the Goblin's powers to pay a visit. The PuPu Adventure Park is meant to be an unforgettable adventure for the heroes, while the PuPu clan works hard to build park facilities to satisfy park visitors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the PuPu clan and Park leader, you'll have full control of the Park operations, the employees (other PuPus) and the facilities: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/4bc0bf5174bfcc38bffecdac73ed7833.avif?t=1763025321\" width=616 height=110 /></span>Staffing and assigning the most &quot;capable&quot; PuPu to run newly-built facilities. The more you make your customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) SWEAT from activities, the more you gain as resources to continue running and expanding the Park. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/0c8745cfd37ae396dd5ae280c1a1165d.avif?t=1763025321\" width=616 height=110 /></span>Design your park by catering to the customers (&quot;heroes&quot;); the Park's offerings will be listed on a mission board where different customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) will come for different demands. Make sure you build a wide range of missions to get the most out of them - including rare items and hero elements, used to upgrade your Park!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/aa3af9fdbad1b5fce1a71a0267f17618.avif?t=1763025321\" width=616 height=110 /></span>From special facilities like the Weapons Shop, the Groceries and the Tailor's, to special customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) like poets, merchants and even bounty hunters...make sure you keep unlocking facilities from the Blueprint to expand the Park. You might also stumble upon some surprising stories in this Park...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/adac064eaf74cba3618d2bc140498f42.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/adac064eaf74cba3618d2bc140498f42.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/adac064eaf74cba3618d2bc140498f42.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/55222d25b2ce97b8b09384089b9f6c64.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/55222d25b2ce97b8b09384089b9f6c64.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/55222d25b2ce97b8b09384089b9f6c64.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/09afc920232525781b76144d68581df3.avif?t=1763025321\" width=616 height=110 /></span>With the expansion of the Park, you will need more &quot;employees&quot;! You will be able to breed more PuPu through the Spring of Life. Grow them and feed them through building houses, cookie machines, and bakeries etc. (Yep, they have a sweet tooth!), you will also have to soothe their mood sometimes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/4ce32641fb585d28a77d0b1d1293c93c.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/4ce32641fb585d28a77d0b1d1293c93c.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/4ce32641fb585d28a77d0b1d1293c93c.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/c48bc13c066ee4986b0482c396ee6d65.avif?t=1763025321\" width=616 height=110 /></span>Don't forget why you're here - ultimately you want to revive the God of PuPu clan so that it brings back the mysterious power of the Spring of Life...the source of PuPu's well-being. But first... You'll need to slave the days away by running your lease from Goblin's Park and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/e9f63d92dd7c2f8e6e4fe10743d99a01.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/e9f63d92dd7c2f8e6e4fe10743d99a01.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/e9f63d92dd7c2f8e6e4fe10743d99a01.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Oh! It's you! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683380/78513eb7882cb985ee8454a7a93d26f74b0a2003.jpg"},{"name":"Let's sign a contract!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683380/254226176cb4916e441720f8ee8547d706ba3bd9.jpg"},{"name":"Adventurers from the other world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683380/8e2e44dddc87ea88bd9c822877a9a8386f508dc9.jpg"},{"name":"Growing Swamp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683380/5e4bc803bbbcca3ea92d0a7c31869a4073f854c2.jpg"},{"name":"Lovely Family","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683380/e827413ec1d225f7cf5fea8c40219becfd2bac9c.jpg"},{"name":"God Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683380/852b202f0c21ab3e113b5413300540cc3ee6bdcc.jpg"},{"name":"The Power of Wisdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683380/6fd94327d1a8e8313cb600f45afbc35d0614e060.jpg"},{"name":"The Power of Courage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683380/f75015fc021cab625d4185a7e72c7a6184d51739.jpg"},{"name":"Hey, this is PuPu too!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683380/4caaedbd9e094e38646a4bbc956b5d01cee3f270.jpg"},{"name":"A Luxury building.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683380/fbd65a23016de3b15a5829b85b18448fdeb17411.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1683380?t=1763025321","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763025321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/c21cb133cbd80d85217f37564490b1cf837ec14f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763025321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/c21cb133cbd80d85217f37564490b1cf837ec14f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763025321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1902890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>EA vs Official Version Comparison</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/50cbb2cd00f1862134d9efb133b83f63.avif?t=1763025321\" width=830 height=8192 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Contact Us</h1><p>Please send us email if you have any feedback or questions.  \ud83d\udc49 <a href=\"mailto:pupuproject@sina.com\">pupuproject@sina.com</a></p><br><h1>Early Access Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/234c8e50b422e6493a88c35b7a124867.avif?t=1763025321\" width=800 height=2868 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to PuPu's Adventure Park! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's what you need to know about this &quot;PARK&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/93ab8e3e87773ffe2928355e58e3cef6.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/93ab8e3e87773ffe2928355e58e3cef6.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/93ab8e3e87773ffe2928355e58e3cef6.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In a not-so-far planet called MoeStar, a long established peace between all clans was disrupted when the Dark Goblins acquired a mysterious &quot;summoning&quot; power, leading to their dominance over the other clans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the long-suffering clans, the PuPu clan, out of desperation and destitution as their life source depletes, are forced to sign a lease from the Goblins to run one of their businesses on the planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The PuPu clan set up shop on this new lease - an Adventure Park - attracting &quot;heroes&quot; who are summoned through the Goblin's powers to pay a visit. The PuPu Adventure Park is meant to be an unforgettable adventure for the heroes, while the PuPu clan works hard to build park facilities to satisfy park visitors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the PuPu clan and Park leader, you'll have full control of the Park operations, the employees (other PuPus) and the facilities: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/4bc0bf5174bfcc38bffecdac73ed7833.avif?t=1763025321\" width=616 height=110 /></span>Staffing and assigning the most &quot;capable&quot; PuPu to run newly-built facilities. The more you make your customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) SWEAT from activities, the more you gain as resources to continue running and expanding the Park. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/1cdc688bc40a1f4268e9b02a59906857.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/0c8745cfd37ae396dd5ae280c1a1165d.avif?t=1763025321\" width=616 height=110 /></span>Design your park by catering to the customers (&quot;heroes&quot;); the Park's offerings will be listed on a mission board where different customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) will come for different demands. Make sure you build a wide range of missions to get the most out of them - including rare items and hero elements, used to upgrade your Park!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/bd4dfef7989bb5a66c52bf0cdb9f2afb.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/aa3af9fdbad1b5fce1a71a0267f17618.avif?t=1763025321\" width=616 height=110 /></span>From special facilities like the Weapons Shop, the Groceries and the Tailor's, to special customers (&quot;heroes&quot;) like poets, merchants and even bounty hunters...make sure you keep unlocking facilities from the Blueprint to expand the Park. You might also stumble upon some surprising stories in this Park...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/adac064eaf74cba3618d2bc140498f42.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/adac064eaf74cba3618d2bc140498f42.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/adac064eaf74cba3618d2bc140498f42.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/55222d25b2ce97b8b09384089b9f6c64.poster.avif?t=1763025321\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/55222d25b2ce97b8b09384089b9f6c64.webm?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683380/extras/55222d25b2ce97b8b09384089b9f6c64.mp4?t=1763025321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">